7. BigVGAN (NVIDIA)
--------------------

The pmetal-vocoder crate reimplements the BigVGAN vocoder (Lee et al., 2023)
and checks its numbers against the reference implementation's: the generator
and its anti-aliased Snake activations, the discriminators (HiFi-GAN's
multi-period discriminator, the multi-resolution, multi-band and multi-scale
sub-band CQT discriminators), the mel front end, the losses and the training
recipe, plus a reader for its released checkpoints.

